## arithmetic-v5: rewritten to the world conventions (the shared library, no external environment).
## Load: libraries (absolute paths), then the original learning/memory settings, then the task.

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

## Settings kept from the original
chunk always
chunk add-osk on
multi-attributes problem 2
multi-attributes column 4
multi-attributes digit 11
multi-attributes add-fact 111
multi-attributes sub-fact 166
multi-attributes inc-fact 11
multi-attributes ten-fact 11

source arithmetic-world.soar
source arithmetic-operators.soar
source process-column.soar
